$18.7&nbsp;million compared to revenues of $4.9&nbsp;million for the six months ended June&nbsp;30, 2023, primarily due to the increase in the average number of our vessels. Total calendar days for our fleet were 598 days for the six months ended
June&nbsp;30, 2024, as compared to 362 days for the same period in 2023. Of the total calendar days in the first six months of 2024, 367 or 61.4%, were time charter days, as compared to 326 or 90.0% for the same period in 2023. Our fleet operational
utilization was 90.3% and 90.1% for the six months ended June&nbsp;30, 2024 and 2023. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
