increase from $0.2&nbsp;million for the same period of last year, due to the increase in the calendar days of our fleet during the current period. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
